//   042 Kadri on the radio about children's food (listening); a nutrition advice column (Markus's milk allergy,
//       Helgi's sweets for the grandchildren), Kadri's blog on a child with an allergy at school (sentence bank);
//       Viktor at the Nõmme culture house — the notice board, Anna's advice, a voice message to Jaan, a letter.
